---
title: "Prescription pad save with an idempotency key (code)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Doctor writing" as s0
  state "Saving" as s1
  state "Save failed or timed out" as s2
  state "Saved" as s3
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the doctor saves a new prescription
  s1 --> s2: the save times out after 30 seconds / the screen shows the server's answer
  s1 --> s3: the screen shows the server's answer
  s2 --> s1: the doctor presses save again / the doctor saves a new prescription
  s3 --> s1: the doctor saves a new prescription
  classDef breaks fill:#fde2dd,stroke:#b3261e,stroke-width:2px
  classDef stuck fill:#fdf0d5,stroke:#a35a05,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:5 3
  classDef breaksAndStuck fill:#fde2dd,stroke:#a35a05,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:5 3
